title Weevil K. Neevil
category Collectibles
folder Companion pets · Quests
keywords My Little Friends, Amaryllis Webb, Entomology Starter Kit, Hay Weevil, Arbor Tarantula, Flesh Picker, weevil, bug, Swamp of Sorrows
collects 280456
levels 25-60
