# Weevil K. Neevil, the reward of My Little Friends from Amaryllis Webb in
# Swamp of Sorrows (new in Forever).
# Sources: Forever's quest data, quest 93176 (giver, level 25); the server's
# quest answers in players' caches (the three specimen objectives and the
# reward: Weevil K. Neevil and 35s); the quest page's completion text ("take
# this... he might have taken a liking to you"); npcs.json (the three bugs:
# Arbor Tarantula 217588, Hay Weevil 217589, Flesh Picker 217590); Forever's
# client data (the kit costs 50s to replace). Its follow-up is A Little Help
# From My Friends (Un'Goro, 50).
# Lint warns that the specimens 213566-213568 are not in items.json (the
# quest's objectives are not in quests.json either): the goals carry their
# names and are counted in the bags.

step My Little Friends
  tip Amaryllis Webb, a Forsaken bug collector, keeps her menagerie in western Swamp of Sorrows. She hands you an Entomology Starter Kit: open it for the tools that catch the three bugs. The bugs are far apart (northern Stranglethorn, Arathi Highlands and Desolace), so do them while you pass. If you lose the kit, she sells another for 50s.
  accept 93176

step Arbor Tarantula in Stranglethorn Vale
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The Arbor Tarantulas sit in northern Stranglethorn. Use the kit's tool on one to catch it.
  collect 213566 "Arbor Tarantula Specimen" @43.1,16.7

step Hay Weevil in Arathi Highlands
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The Hay Weevils crawl in the north-west of Arathi Highlands. Use the kit's tool on one.
  collect 213568 "Hay Weevil Specimen" @31.9,28.2

step Flesh Picker in Desolace
  zone Desolace
  tip The Flesh Pickers feed in the Kodo Graveyard in the middle of southern Desolace. Use the kit's tool on one.
  collect 213567 "Flesh Picker Specimen" @48.1,57.1

step Back to Amaryllis Webb
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Hand Amaryllis the three specimens: she gives you Weevil K. Neevil and 35s.
  turnin 93176
  collect 280456 "Weevil K. Neevil" @25.0,54.1
